       value.   This  manual page describes just the differences from the non‐
       reentrant functions.

       Instead of returning a pointer to a statically allocated _n_e_t_e_n_t  struc‐
       ture  as  the  function result, these functions copy the structure into
       the location pointed to by _r_e_s_u_l_t___b_u_f.

       The _b_u_f array is used to store the string fields pointed to by the  re‐
       turned  _n_e_t_e_n_t  structure.   (The nonreentrant functions allocate these
